Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.10,0:01:50.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Third Episode\NDeadly Challenge\NThe Martial Arts Tournament
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.37,0:02:08.37,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, that's enough for now.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.00,0:02:11.00,Default,,0,0,0,,That should do.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.08,0:02:13.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, I'm exhausted.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.83,0:02:47.94,Default,,0,0,0,,What is the matter, Your Highness?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.05,0:02:50.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Look at this, Grand Duke Duralumin.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.83,0:02:52.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Is there something wrong with it?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.82,0:02:53.86,Default,,0,0,0,,This is a real sword.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.16,0:02:56.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Does this instructor use real swords even for practice?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.53,0:02:57.60,Default,,0,0,0,,That is outrageous.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.42,0:03:02.68,Default,,0,0,0,,I was the one who chose you as a teacher, how could you do such a thing?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.09,0:03:04.54,Default,,0,0,0,,No, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.57,0:03:05.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Get out!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.90,0:03:06.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Y-Yes, sir...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.07,0:03:12.72,Default,,0,0,0,,By the way, Prince Sapphire, tomorrow is finally the annual martial arts tournament.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.21,0:03:17.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Skilled swordsmen from far and wide are gathering.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.50,0:03:24.90,Default,,0,0,0,,You fools at the gate!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.54,0:03:28.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoa, that knight looks incredibly strong.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.73,0:03:32.60,Default,,0,0,0,,I am participating in the martial arts tournament by invitation of the Kingdom of Silverland.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.80,0:03:33.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Make way!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.90,0:03:42.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, ah, ah, wait! Hold on!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.62,0:03:47.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, I'm telling you I have an invitation, look...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.48,0:03:54.10,Default,,0,0,0,,You coward, you failed!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.67,0:03:59.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Knight Baron, entering for the martial arts tournament.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.92,0:04:04.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Here we go.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.23,0:04:28.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Looks like I passed.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.59,0:04:29.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Wow, that's incredible!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.90,0:04:32.36,Default,,0,0,0,,A reliable guy has appeared.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.54,0:04:33.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Give it your all in the match!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.27,0:04:38.06,Default,,0,0,0,,He'll beat Sapphire to a pulp and finish him off.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.49,0:04:40.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh no, this is terrible!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.64,0:04:41.86,Default,,0,0,0,,They say he's going to kill Sapphire!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.26,0:04:43.26,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't just stand around!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.58,0:04:45.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Konotori-chan, please!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.72,0:05:11.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoa!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.56,0:05:12.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Doesn't look like I can get in there.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.24,0:05:15.86,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, I'll go inside this.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.25,0:05:17.35,Default,,0,0,0,,He's stealing my lunch!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.48,0:05:27.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Go on, let me in. I'm Competitor Baron.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.12,0:05:29.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Please, come right in.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.36,0:05:31.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Good work.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.28,0:05:33.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.21,0:05:35.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Competitor Guillotine.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.74,0:05:36.21,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.31,0:05:43.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, so you did show up after all!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.75,0:05:46.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, it's you. Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.40,0:05:51.16,Default,,0,0,0,,The scar you gave me is itching to take you down!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.32,0:05:54.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Ha, the scar across my face says the exact same thing!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.12,0:05:56.24,Default,,0,0,0,,I won't let you get away this time!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.48,0:05:57.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Same here.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.60,0:06:00.46,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna send you to heaven and take the prize money.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.68,0:06:02.10,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.76,0:06:06.88,Default,,0,0,0,,That's pretty intense.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.24,0:06:09.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Ugh.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.36,0:06:15.64,Default,,0,0,0,,I am Prince Sapphire.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.05,0:06:19.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you for coming all this way for this martial arts tournament.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.92,0:06:24.74,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll be competing alongside everyone, but please don't go easy on me just because I'm a prince or a child.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.07,0:06:27.94,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm much stronger than you all think.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.28,0:06:41.28,Default,,0,0,0,,What's so funny?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.02,0:06:47.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Quite the skill for a kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.66,0:06:49.88,Default,,0,0,0,,If you laugh again, I won't forgive you next time.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.68,0:06:57.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Foolish prince, if he angers those powerful fighters, there's no way he'll come out unscathed.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.56,0:07:01.38,Default,,0,0,0,,It'll be one of those powerful fighters...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.91,0:07:06.20,Default,,0,0,0,,The opening ceremony will now begin.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.65,0:07:09.10,Default,,0,0,0,,A few words from his grace Grand Duke Duralumin.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.20,0:07:14.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Competitors, even if your opponent is Prince Sapphire, please fight with all your might.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.12,0:07:18.10,Default,,0,0,0,,This is also the Prince's own wish.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.37,0:07:21.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, for Part 1,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.85,0:07:23.68,Default,,0,0,0,,we will conduct three preliminary events.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.70,0:07:28.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Those who score 100 points across the\Nthree events will advance to the finals.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.78,0:07:30.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Good luck to you all.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.38,0:07:52.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Contestant Feister, 91 points.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.82,0:07:54.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Next is His Highness Prince Sapphire.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.04,0:07:57.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't go getting 100 points!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.12,0:08:00.64,Default,,0,0,0,,If you enter the match, you'll be killed!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.76,0:08:16.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Prince Sapphire.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.37,0:08:18.42,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, 0 points!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.42,0:08:24.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Prince Sapphire, 0 points.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.02,0:08:30.12,Default,,0,0,0,,No, wait, 100 points!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.11,0:08:53.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Contestant Riel, 85 points.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.82,0:08:57.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Moving on, the final event.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.92,0:09:00.24,Default,,0,0,0,,First up, His Highness Prince Sapphire.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.05,0:09:17.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Prince Sapphire, perfect score!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.76,0:09:30.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Contestant Guillotine also gets 100 points!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.68,0:09:53.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop the match!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.12,0:10:07.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Sapphire.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.24,0:10:08.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Tink.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.50,0:10:09.24,Default,,0,0,0,,What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.46,0:10:10.58,Default,,0,0,0,,You're completely covered in soot!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.00,0:10:14.54,Default,,0,0,0,,How's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.54,0:10:14.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Tink.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.12,0:10:16.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Aren't I amazing?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.44,0:10:18.22,Default,,0,0,0,,This is no time to brag!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.08,0:10:20.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey Sapphire, doesn't your stomach hurt?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.30,0:10:22.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Doesn't your head hurt?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.64,0:10:24.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, doesn't anything hurt?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.52,0:10:26.40,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you talking about, Tink?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.43,0:10:29.14,Default,,0,0,0,,You have to stay out of the finals.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.57,0:10:31.57,Default,,0,0,0,,No way.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.68,0:10:33.32,Default,,0,0,0,,No, you'll get killed!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.34,0:10:33.96,Default,,0,0,0,,I know...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.18,0:10:36.53,Default,,0,0,0,,that Duralumin is trying to kill me in the match.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.55,0:10:38.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Then that's all the more reason you can't!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.94,0:10:40.40,Default,,0,0,0,,All I have to do is win, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.80,0:10:43.18,Default,,0,0,0,,No! I said no! Absolutely not!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.23,0:10:48.66,Default,,0,0,0,,At last, it's the final match.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.68,0:10:51.50,Default,,0,0,0,,The remaining seven contestants have all earned a perfect score of 100 points so far.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.37,0:10:55.88,Default,,0,0,0,,A perfect score... quite a formidable opponent, indeed.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.90,0:10:56.98,Default,,0,0,0,,That is correct.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.40,0:11:02.13,Default,,0,0,0,,One of them will surely, without a doubt, get rid of Prince Sapphire.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.24,0:11:05.38,Default,,0,0,0,,However, Prince Sapphire is also quite skilled.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.61,0:11:07.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Make doubly sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.21,0:11:09.22,Default,,0,0,0,,As you can see.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.55,0:11:11.55,Default,,0,0,0,,How does it seem?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.12,0:11:16.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Lord Duralumin likes the kind of person who finishes off their opponent.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.18,0:11:20.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmph, I make a living traveling from one martial arts tournament to another to earn prize money.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.38,0:11:21.38,Default,,0,0,0,,That's reassuring.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.80,0:11:24.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, there's someone I want you to put to sleep.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.55,0:11:25.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Who?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.81,0:11:27.06,Default,,0,0,0,,You know without me having to say it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.20,0:11:30.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.68,0:11:32.64,Default,,0,0,0,,If things go well, I'll pay ten times this amount.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.88,0:11:33.88,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll take it now.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.98,0:11:35.54,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll keep your promise anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.80,0:11:37.88,Default,,0,0,0,,See you, Baron.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.58,0:11:39.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey. Hm?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.36,0:11:43.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Baron, you've really fallen low.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.08,0:11:45.08,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.53,0:11:48.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you really going to kill that little prince just for a bit of money?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.58,0:11:52.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmph, spare me the lecture.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.43,0:11:54.00,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm a ruthless professional.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.03,0:11:57.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Then why don't you fight them instead of taking their money?!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.09,0:12:00.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.13,0:12:02.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, don't get mad. Let's do our fighting in the arena.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.09,0:12:08.06,Default,,0,0,0,,We will now begin the final tournament.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.58,0:12:10.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Although this is strictly a match,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.30,0:12:12.30,Default,,0,0,0,,even if someone happens to lose their life,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.32,0:12:14.02,Default,,0,0,0,,it will not be considered murder.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.68,0:12:15.80,Default,,0,0,0,,How can they allow this?!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.82,0:12:20.48,Default,,0,0,0,,First match: His Highness Prince Sapphire vs. Competitor Mustang.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.84,0:12:24.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Sapphire you're going to get killed!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.65,0:12:26.16,Default,,0,0,0,,You don't need to worry, Tink.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.60,0:12:29.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Tink, what's gotten into you?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.40,0:12:33.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Highness, put on your helmet.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.98,0:12:35.12,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm fine like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.48,0:12:36.70,Default,,0,0,0,,You insolent fool!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.26,0:12:40.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Opal!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.64,0:13:09.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.63,0:13:17.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Got a point!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.92,0:13:24.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Competitor Baron vs. Competitor Folk.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.25,0:13:41.90,Default,,0,0,0,,No good!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.67,0:13:47.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Competitor Guillotine vs. Competitor Yabaam
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.25,0:14:02.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Not this one either?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.40,0:14:04.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Next up is...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.80,0:14:07.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Both of them are no good.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.15,0:14:10.48,Default,,0,0,0,,This is practically a slaughter!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.00,0:14:11.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you scared?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.00,0:14:13.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Will you quit the match, Your Highness?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.90,0:14:14.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Like hell I'll quit!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.19,0:14:18.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Your Highness, you don't have to put on a brave face.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.16,0:14:19.53,Default,,0,0,0,,What did you say?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.56,0:14:19.94,Default,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.97,0:14:21.37,Default,,0,0,0,,You mustn't enter the match!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.39,0:14:22.55,Default,,0,0,0,,I have it under control!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.68,0:14:23.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Sapphire!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.38,0:14:32.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Sapphire!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.08,0:14:34.08,Default,,0,0,0,,What is it, Mother?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.27,0:14:36.73,Default,,0,0,0,,I was so terrified of today's match
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.76,0:14:39.10,Default,,0,0,0,,that I couldn't even bring myself to go watch it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.38,0:14:42.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Please, Sapphire. I beg of you, don't enter any more matches.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.01,0:14:43.53,Default,,0,0,0,,All right?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.64,0:14:45.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Mother, I am a prince.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.30,0:14:47.92,Default,,0,0,0,,If I stop competing halfway through,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.95,0:14:49.52,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll become the laughingstock of the entire kingdom.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.68,0:14:50.72,Default,,0,0,0,,And... and what if...?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.23,0:14:55.04,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm going to find the evidence that Duralumin is plotting to kill me.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.41,0:14:56.41,Default,,0,0,0,,What on earth are you saying?!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.78,0:14:58.58,Default,,0,0,0,,You mustn't say such things.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.03,0:15:01.88,Default,,0,0,0,,You just need to focus on studying to become the king.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.52,0:15:03.97,Default,,0,0,0,,What would I do if my precious,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.99,0:15:06.62,Default,,0,0,0,,precious Sapphire got hurt in a match like that?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.49,0:15:08.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Please, listen to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.69,0:15:13.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, then just tomorrow's finals.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.92,0:15:15.44,Default,,0,0,0,,If you let me do that, I'll study.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.73,0:15:16.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Just once?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.34,0:15:18.34,Default,,0,0,0,,All right!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.38,0:15:19.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Sapphire!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.39,0:15:23.31,Default,,0,0,0,,God, please protect Sapphire.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.07,0:15:30.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, we shall decide the pairings for the semifinals.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.34,0:15:37.92,Default,,0,0,0,,The two who draw the same card will fight each other.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.95,0:15:39.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that clear?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.57,0:16:25.40,Default,,0,0,0,,That's a point!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.49,0:16:30.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Head referee!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.79,0:16:33.79,Default,,0,0,0,,I scored a point!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.72,0:16:39.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Match over!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.22,0:16:47.22,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.86,0:16:48.66,Default,,0,0,0,,This is bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.84,0:16:51.91,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, call a break. Think of something in the meantime.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.94,0:16:52.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.44,0:16:57.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Is it this guy?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.54,0:16:59.58,Default,,0,0,0,, Let's ask him.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.34,0:17:01.51,Default,,0,0,0,,How should I put this?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.54,0:17:03.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Baron and Guillotine have fought 7 times before,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.68,0:17:07.22,Default,,0,0,0,,and all 7 times ended in a mutual hit resulting in a draw, you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.42,0:17:07.85,Default,,0,0,0,,See?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.16,0:17:08.88,Default,,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.77,0:17:10.77,Default,,0,0,0,,But what?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.98,0:17:12.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Without a doubt, it'll be a draw this time as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.08,0:17:14.08,Default,,0,0,0,,What did you say?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.16,0:17:17.52,Default,,0,0,0,,It's incredible how both of them went down in a draw this time.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.14,0:17:23.10,Default,,0,0,0,,They say both of them are concealing special weapons for today's match.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.97,0:17:27.40,Default,,0,0,0,,If both die in a mutual strike, there will be
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.42,0:17:29.22,Default,,0,0,0,,no one left to finish off the prince, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.24,0:17:31.16,Default,,0,0,0,,That's why... we eliminate one of the two.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.75,0:17:34.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Is Guillotine not here yet?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.26,0:17:36.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Even though it's about to start.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.03,0:17:43.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Who is it that wants to meet with me?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.73,0:17:46.72,Default,,0,0,0,,What business do you have calling me out to a place like this?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.51,0:17:52.64,Default,,0,0,0,,You intend to set me up, don't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.35,0:18:08.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Why are you targeting me?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.21,0:18:12.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Look, we know Sapphire is strong now, so please stop the match already.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.00,0:18:15.14,Default,,0,0,0,,There's only the final match left.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.32,0:18:16.32,Default,,0,0,0,,So...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.50,0:18:22.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Here I go!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.70,0:18:38.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Look out!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.00,0:18:47.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Baron, it's a sneak attack!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.13,0:18:52.13,Default,,0,0,0,,A sneak attack?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.78,0:18:54.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Who would do such a terrible thing...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.73,0:18:56.14,Default,,0,0,0,,What?! Guillotine ran away?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.51,0:18:58.66,Default,,0,0,0,,That's right. He's probably afraid of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.20,0:19:00.20,Default,,0,0,0,,That's preposterous.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.31,0:19:02.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Guillotine is a brave and honorable man.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.00,0:19:05.08,Default,,0,0,0,,But if he can't be found, it can't be helped.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.33,0:19:08.14,Default,,0,0,0,,We will hold the final match against Prince Sapphire right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.80,0:19:09.88,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't understand what's going on.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.19,0:19:11.36,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm counting on you, Baron.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.48,0:19:12.84,Default,,0,0,0,,The prize money is 20 times the usual.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.62,0:19:14.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Baron!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.33,0:19:15.55,Default,,0,0,0,,You killed Guillotine!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.46,0:19:21.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoa!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.29,0:19:23.29,Default,,0,0,0,,That's a cowardly move, Baron!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.58,0:19:25.00,Default,,0,0,0,,I haven't even prepared yet!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.09,0:19:26.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Start of the final match!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.18,0:19:27.93,Default,,0,0,0,,What did you say?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.00,0:19:28.81,Default,,0,0,0,,The final match?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.93,0:19:30.17,Default,,0,0,0,,It's the final match, you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.36,0:19:34.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Here I go!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.13,0:19:40.44,Default,,0,0,0,,What happened, Baron!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.72,0:19:41.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Guillotine ran away!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.77,0:19:44.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Guillotine was ambushed!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.90,0:19:45.28,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.40,0:19:46.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Killed?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.22,0:19:47.22,Default,,0,0,0,,No way!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.36,0:19:50.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Baron!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.40,0:19:51.48,Default,,0,0,0,,You had him done in, didn't you!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.00,0:19:53.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Ridiculous!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.22,0:19:55.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Because you were scared of Guillotine, right!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.23,0:19:55.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Baron!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.98,0:19:57.26,Default,,0,0,0,,You're a coward!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.69,0:20:01.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Killed by someone...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.31,0:20:04.31,Default,,0,0,0,,I see...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.56,0:20:07.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.36,0:20:08.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop it!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.68,0:20:19.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh God!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.68,0:20:40.48,Default,,0,0,0,,It's over...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.92,0:20:41.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't underestimate me!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.56,0:20:42.56,Default,,0,0,0,,I won!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.59,0:20:43.89,Default,,0,0,0,,I won't lose to anyone!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.26,0:20:44.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Highness!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.82,0:20:46.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Let me tell you this much!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.37,0:20:48.74,Default,,0,0,0,,You are completely blind!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.76,0:20:53.69,Default,,0,0,0,,At this rate, someone will deceive you before long,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.71,0:20:55.78,Default,,0,0,0,,and steal away both your throne and your country!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.90,0:20:57.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't talk like a sore loser!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.25,0:21:00.68,Default,,0,0,0,,At first, I thought about ending your life.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.30,0:21:02.54,Default,,0,0,0,,But I decided against it.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.74,0:21:04.69,Default,,0,0,0,,So, are you saying you can beat me?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.28,0:21:07.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, enjoy your conceit while it lasts.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.68,0:21:19.68,Default,,0,0,0,,That bastard Baron!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.89,0:21:31.62,Default,,0,0,0,,So you finally showed up.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.36,0:21:34.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Why did you lose on purpose, Baron!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.06,0:21:34.78,Default,,0,0,0,,What happened to our deal!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.02,0:21:36.60,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm taking back the money I gave you—and your life!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.93,0:21:38.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Unfortunately, I can't give you either.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.63,0:21:42.47,Default,,0,0,0,,And now, allow me to avenge Guillotine!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.72,0:21:59.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Good grief! You bunch of cowards!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.36,0:22:03.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.88,0:22:07.88,Default,,0,0,0,,There you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.92,0:22:09.92,Default,,0,0,0,,You arrogant brat!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.04,0:22:10.62,Default,,0,0,0,,I've been waiting for you!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.94,0:22:12.95,Default,,0,0,0,,How dare you half-ass our match earlier!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.06,0:22:14.42,Default,,0,0,0,,We're fighting for real right here!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.45,0:22:15.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn you!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.63,0:22:18.04,Default,,0,0,0,,This should be enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.46,0:22:19.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Why won't you draw your sword!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.42,0:22:20.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Here I come!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.26,0:22:22.26,Default,,0,0,0,,From above!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.21,0:22:30.00,Default,,0,0,0,,From above!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.77,0:22:34.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.26,0:22:38.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Can you even move?!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.54,0:22:41.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Before you can even use the sword in your right hand, I'll slice your throat!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.15,0:22:44.64,Default,,0,0,0,,This is the skill of a professional, My Lord Prince.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.85,0:22:48.54,Default,,0,0,0,,If you don't get stronger, your life is going to be in danger.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.28,0:22:50.90,Default,,0,0,0,,You have both courage and wisdom.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.35,0:22:53.32,Default,,0,0,0,,But it seems this country is full of bad guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.96,0:22:56.82,Default,,0,0,0,,To fight them, you must train much, much more!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.84,0:22:58.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Well then, take care of yourself!
